# Think Twice: "Flashback {2}{U}" (CR 702.34a): a spell cast with flashback is exiled instead of going anywhere else when it leaves the stack, so
# when Bot2 Cancels the flashback Think Twice it goes to exile, not the graveyard, and Bot1 draws nothing from it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Think Twice
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Cancel
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Think Twice.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Think Twice
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Graveyard.Think Twice.Cast(Ability: Flashback)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot2.Hand.Cancel.Cast(Stack.Think Twice)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Exile = Think Twice
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot2.Graveyard = Cancel; Black Lotus
